    </Box>
    <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 24, right: 60, fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>03 / 20</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>一线履历：三个可验证的企业级项目</Text>
        <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 12 }}>不是二手案例——这三个项目，都是我本人负责、驻场或验收过的。</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 18, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 336, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 8, background: '#7C3AED', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>01</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>百度智慧城市</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#7C3AED' }}>驻场产品经理</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A4560', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>城市级项目长期驻场：把政企方的业务诉求翻译成产品方案，与客户、研发、交付在现场同频推进。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#DDD6FE' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7C3AED' }}>对应课程：W4 用户研究与需求分析</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 336, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 8, background: '#2563EB', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>02</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E1B4B' }}>甘肃省科技厅项目</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB' }}>项目负责人 · 省成果转化平台</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A4560', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>项目经理 + 产品 + 测试三角色兼任：定原型与开发方案、控制进度、完成全流程测试并参与验收汇报。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: '#BFDBFE' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2563EB' }}>对应课程：W5 项目推进与跨团队协作</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 336, background: '#F5F3FF', borderRadius: 14, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 34, height: 34, borderRadius: 8, background: '#7C3AED', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>03</Text>
